# Do not put real secrets in this file. It documents what must be configured.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY must be stored as a Firebase secret (not an env var), e.g.:
#   firebase functions:secrets:set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
#
# Optional: restrict who can call this function without adding full Firebase Auth.
# If set, callers must send header  X-APYVION-Client-Key: <same value>.
# Set it the same way as above:
#   firebase functions:secrets:set APYVION_CLIENT_KEY
# Leave it unset only for local testing — an open AI endpoint on the public
# internet can run up your Anthropic bill if left unprotected.
